# system.intliteral / system.floatliteral / system.textliteral -- the
# compile-time literal types.
# BODYLESS ON PURPOSE: a literal's conversion is settled by the CHECKER, which
# either pins the value to the target type or reports that it does not fit, so
# there is nothing left to emit. The rows exist because a declaration marked
# `is native` must name a path the table knows (checkNativesResolve), and they
# sit outside the generated block because `zc natives` rewrites only that block.
